      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that fetches a document by identifier from a managed NoSQL store. I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the concrete external provider for this task. The script will use the Boto3 library to interact with DynamoDB, which will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
